 sauva / Help                                                                           Copy Dialog

 About
  sauva - Terminal Unicode Explorer

  Version: 1.2.3

  https://example.com/sauva

 Keybindings · Copy Dialog
  k  Up                    Select the previous copy candidate
  j  Down                  Select the next copy candidate
  g  Home                  Select the first copy candidate
  G  End                   Select the last copy candidate
  Enter                    Copy the selected candidate
  Esc                      Cancel and return to the source screen
  Ctrl-c                   Quit
  F1                       Open or close help

  Copy the selected code point, its whole grapheme cluster, or the whole input or normalization
  result. Text is copied exactly; preview labels and dotted circles are display aids only. Closing
  help returns to the same copy candidate.







